---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../components/blocks/LegalPage.astro";
import { SITE, CONTACT, ANALYTICS } from "../lib/constants";
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" title={`Privacy — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="What the enquiry form collects, what analytics does once you consent, and your rights under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020.">
  <LegalPage title="Privacy"
             lede="What we collect, why, and how to get rid of it. Written to be read rather than to be survived.">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is a small tour operator based in New Zealand. We are the agency
      responsible for the personal information described here. You can reach us at
      <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What the enquiry form collects</h2>
    <p>
      When you send an enquiry we collect your name, email address, and optionally your
      phone number, the tour you are asking about, your rough dates, how many of you
      there are, and anything you write in the message field.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use it for one thing: to answer your enquiry and, if you go on to book, to run
      the trip. We do not sell it, we do not share it with anyone who is not directly
      involved in delivering your tour, and we do not add you to a mailing list because
      you asked a question.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We would like to use Google Analytics to see which pages people actually read.
      <strong>Nothing loads and nothing is sent until you explicitly agree.</strong> No
      script, no cookie, and no request to Google of any kind is made before you choose.
      If you decline, we clear any analytics cookies a previous choice had set.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you do consent, we grant analytics storage only. Advertising signals — ad
      storage, ad personalisation, ad user data — are never granted anywhere on this
      site. Your choice is remembered for {ANALYTICS.renewDays} days, after which we ask
      again, and you can change it at any time from “Cookie preferences” in the footer.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020 you can ask us what personal information we
      hold about you, ask us to correct it, and ask us to delete it. Email us and we will
      action it. If you are in the EU or UK, the equivalent rights under the GDPR apply
      and we will honour them the same way.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Enquiries that do not turn into bookings are deleted after twelve months. Booking
      records are kept for seven years, because New Zealand tax law requires it.
    </p>

    <h2>A note on this site</h2>
    <p>
      This is a demonstration website for a company that does not exist. No enquiry form
      on it is connected to an inbox, and no information you type into it is transmitted
      or stored anywhere.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
